(7436762, 1175410, 63218, '<td valign="top">Kind of an uninspiring skyline which you made fascinating by the pano &amp; the choices you made in post-processing. Well done! The blue is perfect. It''s so long, I start wondering if you captured your shots from a car driving a road on the opposite shore miles away, or it''s a 360 pano. I hope you included some Notes for me. Inquiring minds want to know.</td>', 'Kind of an uninspiring skyline which you made fascinating by the pano & the choices you made in post-processing. Well done! The blue is perfect. It''s so long, I start wondering if you captured your shots from a car driving a road on the opposite shore miles away, or it''s a 360 pano. I hope you included some Notes for me. Inquiring minds want to know.', '2016-02-13 10:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
