(7437182, 1175560, 54446, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sns:</b></div><hr/><i> Lovely, I would suggest cropping off the small are at the bottom to remove the light brown area. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>No, thanks!  Your suggestion would remove "grounding" of scene and reduce illusion of 3 dimensions.  <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by sns: Lovely, I would suggest cropping off the small are at the bottom to remove the light brown area.  No, thanks!  Your suggestion would remove "grounding" of scene and reduce illusion of 3 dimensions.  ', '2016-02-15 03:35:55.000000', NULL, 0),
