(7437244, 1175629, 63218, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pixelpig:</b></div><hr/><i> z </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I beg your pardon for the seeming rudeness of the ''z'' comment. Here''s what happened (I think)--I often vote a night when it''s quiet. I usually look at the image for a while while thinking about a comment. Sometimes I fall asleep. I think I must''ve hit the z without knowing it, &amp; then voted. I couldn''t think of anything to say other than it''s a great shot of an awesome bird, in a truly classic pose. I would be very pleased to capture such a shot myself. Well done!</td>', 'Originally posted by pixelpig: z   I beg your pardon for the seeming rudeness of the ''z'' comment. Here''s what happened (I think)--I often vote a night when it''s quiet. I usually look at the image for a while while thinking about a comment. Sometimes I fall asleep. I think I must''ve hit the z without knowing it, & then voted. I couldn''t think of anything to say other than it''s a great shot of an awesome bird, in a truly classic pose. I would be very pleased to capture such a shot myself. Well done!', '2016-02-15 11:33:32.000000', NULL, 0),
